>Where We Meet

The location may vary, but we're normally at CGI, 570 Polaris Pkwy, Suite 200, Westerville, Ohio 43082 — second floor, at the end of the hallway. Bring nothing but yourself and some curiosity, and a project or gadget if you've got one.

